&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are interested in applying for one of our&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;international locations&lt;/strong&gt;, please visit our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.crai.com/cra-careers/&quot;&gt;Careers site&lt;/a&gt; to view and apply for available jobs.&lt;/p&gt;
